## Phase 4 — Auth System

### Models
- [ ] `models/UserModel.php` — `register()`, `login()`, `findByEmail()`, `verifyOTP()`

### Controllers
- [ ] `controllers/AuthController.php` — Handle register, login, OTP verification, logout

### Views
- [ ] `views/auth/register.php` — Registration form (name, email, phone, password)
- [ ] `views/auth/login.php` — Login form (email + password)
- [ ] `views/auth/otp.php` — OTP input page
- [ ] `views/auth/logout.php` — Destroy session, redirect

### OTP Logic
- [ ] Generate 6-digit code → save to `otp_codes` table
- [ ] Send via email (use PHP `mail()` or Mailtrap for dev)
- [ ] Verify code + expiry on submit
- [ ] Set `users.is_verified = TRUE` on success

> [!IMPORTANT]
> Hash passwords with `password_hash()` on register and verify with `password_verify()` on login. Never store plain text.

