## Phase 7 — BNPL Core: Installments

This is the heart of the app.

### Business Logic
```
total_price       = product price
commission        = total_price × merchant.commission_rate
merchant_earning  = total_price − commission
installments      = split total into 3 or 4 equal monthly payments
```

### Models
- [ ] `models/InstallmentModel.php` — `createForOrder()`, `getByOrder()`, `markPaid()`, `getOverdue()`

### Controllers
- [ ] `controllers/InstallmentController.php` — Generate installments on order, handle payment

### Views
- [ ] `views/user/my_orders.php` — List orders with installment status
- [ ] `views/user/installment_detail.php` — Show due dates, amounts, pay button
- [ ] `views/merchant/earnings.php` — Earnings after commission

### Flow
- [ ] User clicks "Buy Now Pay Later" → order created → installments auto-generated
- [ ] User sees installment schedule (e.g., 3 × 333.33 DH)
- [ ] User marks installment as paid (simulate for now)
- [ ] Order status updates to `paid` when all installments are paid

> [!IMPORTANT]
> Eligibility check before BNPL: user must be verified (`is_verified = TRUE`) AND financial status must be `approved`.

