## Recommended Build Order

| Step | What to build | Why |
|------|--------------|-----|
| 1 | ~~Config + Error Handling~~ | ✅ Done |
| 2 | `includes/` (session, helpers, header/footer) | Everything depends on these |
| 3 | `index.php` router | Need routing before any page works |
| 4 | Auth (register → OTP → login → logout) | Must have users before anything else |
| 5 | User verification (KYC) | Required before users can buy |
| 6 | Merchant products (CRUD) | Need products for orders |
| 7 | Orders + Installments (BNPL core) | The main feature |
| 8 | Admin panel | Approve verifications, monitor platform |
| 9 | Security hardening | Lock everything down |
| 10 | Polish + deploy | Final UI, testing, production config |
